{"id":"3ce8a66e6c0444a6","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-zfc-measure8-koopman-representation.md","title":"ZFC Measure8 Koopman Representation","display":"df-zfc-measure8-koopman-representation — ZFC Measure8 Koopman Representation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-measure8-koopman-representation","aliases":["58-df-zfc-measure8-koopman-representation"],"display":"df-zfc-measure8-koopman-representation — ZFC Measure8 Koopman Representation","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-bijective.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md]]","[[../batch20/58-df-lp-space.md]]","[[58-df-zfc-measure2-measurable-map.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-measure8-koopman-representation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-measure8-koopman-representation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-measure8-koopman-representation — ZFC Measure8 Koopman Representation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d583890235faf0d5\" href=\"?note=d583890235faf0d5\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-bijective.md\">../batch18/58-df-bijective.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"83a15c7e9b3817dc\" href=\"?note=83a15c7e9b3817dc\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a1d034d5d39b4a14\" href=\"?note=a1d034d5d39b4a14\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-lp-space.md\">../batch20/58-df-lp-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c202e401aa180874\" href=\"?note=c202e401aa180874\" title=\"58-df-zfc-measure2-measurable-map.md\">58-df-zfc-measure2-measurable-map.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\Sigma,\\mu,T,U_T,L_2\\in V\">\\(X,\\Sigma,\\mu,T,U_T,L_2\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2MeasurableMap}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2MeasurableMap}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bijective}\">\\(\\mathrm{Bijective}\\)</span> (see the dependencies)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LpSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{LpSpace}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AeEqual}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{AeEqual}_S\\)</span> (the canonical <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L^p\">\\(L^p\\)</span> quotient and almost-everywhere equality, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a1d034d5d39b4a14\" href=\"?note=a1d034d5d39b4a14\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-lp-space.md\">../batch20/58-df-lp-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8KoopmanRepresentation}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8KoopmanRepresentation}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure8\\text{-}koopman\\text{-}representation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8KoopmanRepresentation}_S(U_T,T,X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2MeasurableMap}_S(T,X,\\Sigma,X,\\Sigma)\n\\land\\mathrm{Bijective}(T,X,X)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2MeasurableMap}_S(T^{-1},X,\\Sigma,X,\\Sigma)\n\\land\\forall A\\in\\Sigma\\;\\mu(T^{-1}[A])=\\mu(A)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists L_2\\in V\\;\\Biggl[\n\\mathrm{LpSpace}_S(L_2,2;X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(U_T,L_2,L_2)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall C\\in L_2\\;\\forall f\\in C\\;\\Bigl(\nf\\circ T\\in\\bigcup L_2\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{28mm}\\land U_T(C)=\n\\{g\\in\\bigcup L_2:\n\\mathrm{AeEqual}_S(g,f\\circ T;X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\}\n\\Bigr)\\Biggr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure8\\text{-}koopman\\text{-}representation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8KoopmanRepresentation}_S(U_T,T,X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2MeasurableMap}_S(T,X,\\Sigma,X,\\Sigma)\n\\land\\mathrm{Bijective}(T,X,X)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2MeasurableMap}_S(T^{-1},X,\\Sigma,X,\\Sigma)\n\\land\\forall A\\in\\Sigma\\;\\mu(T^{-1}[A])=\\mu(A)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists L_2\\in V\\;\\Biggl[\n\\mathrm{LpSpace}_S(L_2,2;X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(U_T,L_2,L_2)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall C\\in L_2\\;\\forall f\\in C\\;\\Bigl(\nf\\circ T\\in\\bigcup L_2\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{28mm}\\land U_T(C)=\n\\{g\\in\\bigcup L_2:\n\\mathrm{AeEqual}_S(g,f\\circ T;X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\}\n\\Bigr)\\Biggr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The operator acts on the equivalence classes in the registered quotient <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_2\">\\(L_2\\)</span>, not on an unverified quotient expression <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F_2/{\\sim_\\mu}\">\\(\\mathcal F_2/{\\sim_\\mu}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>For every representative <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in C\">\\(f\\in C\\)</span>, the displayed target is the almost-everywhere class of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\circ T\">\\(f\\circ T\\)</span>; measure preservation makes this independent of the representative and keeps it square integrable.</li>\n<li>Invertibility and bimeasurability make this composition operator unitary. For a merely measure-preserving endomorphism it is generally only an isometry.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-bijective.md","status":"resolved","id":"d583890235faf0d5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-bijective.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"83a15c7e9b3817dc","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-lp-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"a1d034d5d39b4a14","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-lp-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-measure2-measurable-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"c202e401aa180874","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-measure2-measurable-map.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-lp-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"a1d034d5d39b4a14","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LpSpace}_S$ and $\\mathrm{AeEqual}_S$ (the canonical $L^p$ quotient and almost-everywhere equality, see [[../batch20/58-df-lp-space.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\Sigma,\\mu,T,U_T,L_2\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2MeasurableMap}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Bijective}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LpSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AeEqual}_S","display":false},{"tex":"L^p","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8KoopmanRepresentation}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure8\\text{-}koopman\\text{-}representation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8KoopmanRepresentation}_S(U_T,T,X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2MeasurableMap}_S(T,X,\\Sigma,X,\\Sigma)\n\\land\\mathrm{Bijective}(T,X,X)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2MeasurableMap}_S(T^{-1},X,\\Sigma,X,\\Sigma)\n\\land\\forall A\\in\\Sigma\\;\\mu(T^{-1}[A])=\\mu(A)\\\\\n&\\land\\exists L_2\\in V\\;\\Biggl[\n\\mathrm{LpSpace}_S(L_2,2;X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(U_T,L_2,L_2)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall C\\in L_2\\;\\forall f\\in C\\;\\Bigl(\nf\\circ T\\in\\bigcup L_2\\\\\n&\\hspace{28mm}\\land U_T(C)=\n\\{g\\in\\bigcup L_2:\n\\mathrm{AeEqual}_S(g,f\\circ T;X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\}\n\\Bigr)\\Biggr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"L_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F_2/{\\sim_\\mu}","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in C","display":false},{"tex":"f\\circ T","display":false}],"bytes":2291,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2653","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-measure8-koopman-representation.md|58-df-zfc-measure8-koopman-representation]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","36d7463d215be751","d583890235faf0d5","83a15c7e9b3817dc","a1d034d5d39b4a14","c202e401aa180874"]}